{
  "sn6.5:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 6.5 ",
  "sn6.5:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn6.5:0.3": "Aññatarabrahmasutta ",
  "sn6.5:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn6.5:1.2": "Tena kho pana samayena aññatarassa brahmuno evarūpaṁ pāpakaṁ diṭṭhigataṁ uppannaṁ hoti: ",
  "sn6.5:1.3": "“natthi so samaṇo vā brāhmaṇo vā yo idha āgaccheyyā”ti. ",
  "sn6.5:1.4": "Atha kho bhagavā tassa brahmuno cetasā cetoparivitakkamaññāya—seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso …pe… tasmiṁ brahmaloke pāturahosi. ",
  "sn6.5:1.5": "Atha kho bhagavā tassa brahmuno upari vehāsaṁ pallaṅkena nisīdi tejodhātuṁ samāpajjitvā. ",
  "sn6.5:2.1": "Atha kho āyasmato mahāmoggallānassa etadahosi: ",
  "sn6.5:2.2": "“kahaṁ nu kho bhagavā etarahi viharatī”ti? ",
  "sn6.5:2.3": "Addasā kho āyasmā mahāmoggallāno bhagavantaṁ dibbena cakkhunā visuddhena atikkantamānusakena tassa brahmuno upari vehāsaṁ pallaṅkena nisinnaṁ tejodhātuṁ samāpannaṁ. ",
  "sn6.5:2.4": "Disvāna—seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya, pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—jetavane antarahito tasmiṁ brahmaloke pāturahosi. ",
  "sn6.5:2.5": "Atha kho āyasmā mahāmoggallāno puratthimaṁ disaṁ nissāya tassa brahmuno upari vehāsaṁ pallaṅkena nisīdi tejodhātuṁ samāpajjitvā nīcataraṁ bhagavato. ",
  "sn6.5:3.1": "Atha kho āyasmato mahākassapassa etadahosi: ",
  "sn6.5:3.2": "“kahaṁ nu kho bhagavā etarahi viharatī”ti? ",
  "sn